    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rebuilding feels like a joke. you can't rebuild a person that everyone has already discarded. it's like the social version of me is already buried. i look in the mirror and i don't see someone who can \"find their way out,\" i just see a corpse that hasn't realized it's finished yet. if i'm already dead to the world, what's the point in pretending i'm still alive?",
